    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Glitchworld is a retro-platform-shooter where the levels change WHILE YOU PLAY! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962550/extras/dbafae803b4bfaf63ffb3e8b3bd172a9.avif?t=1738750746\" width=180 height=180 /></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962550/extras/a0a52e9e23d4f9a21bf65defeb263467.avif?t=1738750746\" width=180 height=180 /></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962550/extras/1429c50071f86894e6fc300232837fe6.avif?t=1738750746\" width=180 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How did it come to this? Well, we\u2019re sorry to admit it, but our main pixel character was trying to use cheat codes in his own game and ended up breaking it\u2026 Now a massive glitch will teleport our hero randomly from one level to the next and back again\u2026 while you are playing!  Sorry about that\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Well, let\u2019s make the best out of it, shall we?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you last in this challenging, fast-paced and fun endless runner? Chase the high score in stunning pixel art backgrounds fighting off retro-styled enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962550/extras/650772b7c7bf9b52fba9febb1e58297a.avif?t=1738750746\" width=600 height=322 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning pixel art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated levels - never play the same game twice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, fun and challenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Glitchworld either as a short, casual \u201cpalate-cleanser\u201d-game\u2026</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OR play it for hours, chasing the best high score!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Joypad</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B: Fire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Keyboard:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space: Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRTL: Fire</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Glitchworld is a retro-platform-shooter where the levels change WHILE YOU PLAY! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962550/extras/dbafae803b4bfaf63ffb3e8b3bd172a9.avif?t=1738750746\" width=180 height=180 /></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962550/extras/a0a52e9e23d4f9a21bf65defeb263467.avif?t=1738750746\" width=180 height=180 /></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962550/extras/1429c50071f86894e6fc300232837fe6.avif?t=1738750746\" width=180 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How did it come to this? Well, we\u2019re sorry to admit it, but our main pixel character was trying to use cheat codes in his own game and ended up breaking it\u2026 Now a massive glitch will teleport our hero randomly from one level to the next and back again\u2026 while you are playing!  Sorry about that\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Well, let\u2019s make the best out of it, shall we?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you last in this challenging, fast-paced and fun endless runner? Chase the high score in stunning pixel art backgrounds fighting off retro-styled enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962550/extras/650772b7c7bf9b52fba9febb1e58297a.avif?t=1738750746\" width=600 height=322 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning pixel art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated levels - never play the same game twice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, fun and challenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Glitchworld either as a short, casual \u201cpalate-cleanser\u201d-game\u2026</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OR play it for hours, chasing the best high score!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Joypad</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B: Fire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Keyboard:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space: Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRTL: Fire</p>",
